  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/792",
  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>6.1. 역학적 에너지 보존 실험은</p><p>학생들이 계산도 어려워하고,&#160;</p><p>실제 실험할 때, 실험결과가 잘 나오기 어렵다고 생각이 드는데요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이를 시뮬레이션으로 수업에 활용하고 있어 공유드립니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">프로그램은&#160; 역시 VPython을 사용했습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">c언어를 미약하게....아주 미약하게 아는 저로서는 이런 시뮬레이션으로는 가장 편한 듯하여 사용하고 있습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.glowscript.org/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Web VPython\" data-og-description=\"VPython is an easy-to-use, powerful environment for creating 3D animations. Here at glowscript.org (or webvpython.org, which takes you here), you can write and run VPython programs right in your browser, store them in the cloud for free, and easily share t\" data-og-host=\"www.glowscript.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\" data-og-url=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cUXbKo/hyU8469ejQ/P13nCJjfeCG0daD5dTSCn0/img.jpg?width=368&amp;height=392&amp;face=0_0_368_392\"><a href=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cUXbKo/hyU8469ejQ/P13nCJjfeCG0daD5dTSCn0/img.jpg?width=368&amp;height=392&amp;face=0_0_368_392\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Web VPython</p><p class=\"og-desc\">VPython is an easy-to-use, powerful environment for creating 3D animations. Here at glowscript.org (or webvpython.org, which takes you here), you can write and run VPython programs right in your browser, store them in the cloud for free, and easily share t</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.glowscript.org</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">해당 사이트 들어가셔서, 해당하는&#160; 코딩을 복사, 붙혀넣기 하시면 시뮬레이션 돌릴 수 있을 것같습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">모든 시뮬레이션은 낙하 실험을 구현해놓았습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. 역학적에너지 보존 (시간)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">원하는 전체 시간을 기준으로 나눠서, 같은 시간 간격으로</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">높이, 속력, 운동에너지/위치에너지 그리고 역학적에너지를 측정하도록 만들어져 있습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">같은 시간 간격으로 표시되다보니 자유낙하시 속력(같은 시간동안 이동한 거리)을 분석하는데도 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvly83aazslwl3sirrf7r1n3f@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvly83aazslwl3sirrf7r1n3f/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33262886356&amp;signature=iAhwuGoKVLzqu%2Fj4SD4K%2FDXeEmc%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvly83aazslwl3sirrf7r1n3f?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2bHk4M2FhenNsd2wzc2lycmY3cjFuM2YiLCJ0aWQiOiIwY2JjMTc2ZC01ZDc5LTQzMmUtYTdhMC1kZTM5YWY2MTYyMDciLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODI0MDV9.b9DWQSdVsGbeUaHZkn35ghb9728w3-nI8GdtSgfkfZuwurzhid0fjTfx-eiL88kaRBhw1qs8G-TRIXf10UY8Lg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">역학적에너지 보존 (시간)</div></div><p>2. 역학적에너지 보존 (높이)</p><p>원하는 전체 높이를 기준으로 같은 높이 간격으로,</p><p>높이, 속력, 운동에너지/위치에너지 그리고 역학적에너지를 측정하도록 만들어져 있습니다.</p><p>같은 높이 간격으로 표시되다보니 점점 속력을 측정하는 시간폭이 짧아지는 것을 느낄 수 있습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvhwyhhd1sgobw81cljxmspsk@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvhwyhhd1sgobw81cljxmspsk/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33262886613&amp;signature=AZwZpiWnmXjMlNJSNu1K1vszl5g%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvhwyhhd1sgobw81cljxmspsk?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2aHd5aGhkMXNnb2J3ODFjbGp4bXNwc2siLCJ0aWQiOiJmODAxNGNlYS1hY2RiLTRmNTQtYjkxMy0zZTA3Yzc4NzNmYWQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODI0MDV9.qzk0a2KvWziipmDXqnkqotYWuntjH8vlGzdNF58mjM4qTTCw4XnGHqs0oRncOKsd-mSz1665U-YKPMzrxtSkOw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">역학적에너지 보존 (높이)</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>- 다만... 코딩의 한계로... 40초면 딱 40초, 100m면 딱 100m가 아니라...</p><p>조금 넘칠때 측정하더라구요...</p><p>그래서 기준면보다 아래일때 측정하고, 소수점의 한계로 살짝 역학적에너지가 달라지거나 그럽니다...</p><p>혹시 고치는 방법을 아시는 선생님들께 도움! 부탁드립니다!!</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06c76c5c42310423715ce9a0ee70c80bb4687ae3?download\" data-file-name=\"역학적에너지 보존 (시간).txt\" data-file-size=\"2979\" data-mimetype=\"text/plain\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D792%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20240123114910&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F06c76c5c42310423715ce9a0ee70c80bb4687ae3')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">역학적에너지 보존 (시간)</span><span class=\"type\">.txt</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.91KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d09b983b00bb76ac6ae2cf09bbb3d15bcdfce215?download\" data-file-name=\"역학적에너지 보존 (높이).txt\" data-file-size=\"2784\" data-mimetype=\"text/plain\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D792%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20240123114910&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fd09b983b00bb76ac6ae2cf09bbb3d15bcdfce215')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">역학적에너지 보존 (높이)</span><span class=\"type\">.txt</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.72KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
